### The host's `notify-customer-visit` handler tells the customer when the technician is coming. It runs after the
### dispatch's commit, as its own delivery, and posts to the sink (FieldService:NotificationsUrl) — so it is polled.
# @name CustomerNotices
## RETRY-UNTIL-TEST-PASS: The customer of WO-7001 was told.
## RETRY-MAX-ATTEMPTS: 30
## RETRY-BACKOFF-TYPE: Constant
## RETRY-MAX-DELAY: 00:00:01
POST {{fshSinkUrl}}/__admin/requests/find
Content-Type: application/json

{ "method": "POST", "urlPath": "/notifications/customers" }
